{"title":"1992 AHSME Problems/Problem 18","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AHSME_Problems/Problem_18&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The increasing sequence of positive integers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/7/2/d724bb09afecb11005f0b4c4454c935129b904ea.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_1,a_2,a_3,\\cdots$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"95\" height=\"11\" /> has the property that\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/2/e/72e5280db01a8da1c1a59c1a08713b9d4a3a8d25.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[a_{n+2}=a_n+a_{n+1} \\text{  for all } n\\ge 1.\\]\" width=\"237\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/a/e/cae39912b90a0f79207a82976f77be7b2159d021.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_7=120$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"68\" height=\"15\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/e/a/7ead075983f8dbfa721f00c28be967778b4a6677.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"15\" height=\"10\" /> is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/8/e2840ff664f0bced2ec7503abd45789a3a8f005a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A) } 128\\quad \\text{(B) } 168\\quad \\text{(C) } 193\\quad \\text{(D) } 194\\quad \\text{(E) } 210$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"354\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AHSME_Problems/Problem_18&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/5/8/25809e4f87f20a2ee949878bc603b9eda09422ce.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\fbox{D}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"26\" height=\"24\" /> Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/4/bf4c4dfef826af32570a55d9036accd6a110a9c0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_{1} = a, a_{2} = b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"108\" height=\"16\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/3/c/d3cd7df0970b4d56c2a814b568b2a463a1366f63.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5a + 8b = 120$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"108\" height=\"14\" />. Now <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/e/4/de4d31fe8dc46699c566a57c330722f00dc6cd9f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8b$\" width=\"17\" height=\"12\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/a/a/aaa4de95cc6371d125d5cf773cdd9f9913dd1d8e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$120$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" /> are divisible by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/9/f/e9f1cd011e4f743ca6187ecad0222dce00a68993.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5a$\" width=\"18\" height=\"12\" /> is divisible by 8, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> is divisible by 8. It's now easy to try the multiples of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> to get that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/e/2/be28eb4487ffe3150fc7683e2242531b7b884c20.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = 8, b=10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"100\" height=\"16\" /> (all the other possibilities violate the condition <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/5/f/55f8abc0d69ac6ab491f6125f9550af6b25e22fb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a &lt; b$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"42\" height=\"13\" />, which comes from the fact that the sequence is increasing). Hence <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/d/5ede2d9f48ca5e89d6b61e82aff540a4d419d3d1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_8 = 8a + 13b = 8 \\times 8 + 13 \\times 10 = 194$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"305\" height=\"15\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AHSME_Problems/Problem_18&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AHSME\" title=\"1992 AHSME\">1992 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1992 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1992 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1992\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AHSME_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"1992 AHSME Problems/Problem 17\">Problem 17</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AHSME_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"1992 AHSME Problems/Problem 19\">Problem 19</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a hre